t:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Exempt (salaried)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">License: </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">NP or PA</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Y</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">FTE Hours:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">1.00</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Reports to:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">CMO</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The Director of Advanced Practice Providers (APP) is responsible for promoting the highest clinical quality and effectiveness, embracing a culture of excellence in team-based delivery of clinical services within all TidalHealth locations and service lines.&nbsp; The Director of APP are to lead and monitor APP integration and deliverables within initiatives focused upon optimizing the efficacy and efficiency of clinical operations and improving patient access, services and quality/safety outcomes utilizing a data-driven, process-focused and outcomes-oriented approach and optimize the clinical competencies and training. The Director of APP will lead evidence-based programs, practices, and activities, establish transparent processes to monitor performance against stated goals, and assure accountability for performance as measured by quality, service, and financial outcomes.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Master of Science in nursing (MSN) or Doctor of Nursing Practice (DNP), or:</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Master’s degree in Physician Assistant studies</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">License and/or certification::</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in\">Certified Registered Nurse Practitioner (CRNP) or licensed as a Physician Assistant (PA) </li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Six (6) years of clinical experience as a NP or PA is required. </span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Five (5) years of management experience is preferred. </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Evenings and weekends may be required as needed.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Filippa Etherton, SHRM-SCP<br></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Compensation Manager<br>People Department<br><b>TidalHealth<br>O </b>410-912-6744<br>mytidalhealth.org</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe Script&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}